# This directory is intended for database migration scripts.
# It is typically managed by Alembic, a lightweight database migration tool for SQLAlchemy.

# To initialize the Alembic environment, run:
# alembic init migrations

# After initializing, you can create a new migration script using:
# alembic revision --autogenerate -m "Initial migration"

# To apply migrations, use:
# alembic upgrade head

# Note: Ensure that your database URL is correctly set in alembic.ini